The coins is a list of 1 and 3.
The target is 6.
The last is the last position of coins.
The miss is 1.
The spot is 0.
The patches is 0.
Repeat while miss is at most target.
The took is 0.
If spot is at most last and item spot of coins is at most miss, set miss to miss plus item spot of coins, add 1 to spot, set took to 1.
If took is 0, add 1 to patches, set miss to miss plus miss.

Show patches.
